<ul dir="auto">
<li><strong>Share</strong>: a new button in the dashboard toolbar exports what you're looking at (one project or all, the chosen period) as an image or a PDF, dated, ready to send to a partner. Share, copy or save.</li>
<li><strong>MRR bridge</strong>: the first and last bars now read "MRR 30 days ago" and "MRR today".</li>
<li><strong>MRR movements</strong> and <strong>Revenue collected</strong> headline the last 30 days instead of the calendar month, so they no longer show 0 on the 1st.</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
